Z||000000||coolcat||07-02-2001||01:52 PM||||All I can say is that yesterday was a verrrry good day. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">After the death of my 87GT I've been in the market for another one.BUT I wanted a 87GT T-TOP. It's been about 3months and I had just about given up finding one locally and in the 4-5 range. Well Friday I just happened to pick up the Auto Trader and there to my total astonishment was a silver 87GT T-TOP located about 20miles from my home. NOW THIS IS WHERE IT GETS WIERD.I call the number and the machine picks up I listen to the message and the person on it sounds strangely familiar, then it hits me holly sh!t this is the same person that sold me my other GT.TOOOO WIERD. So I leave a message and explain who I am. Well that was early Friday. Saturday comes and goes nothing then Sunday nothing I gave up,then at about 5:30pm Sunday the phone rings guess who it is  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.I talk to the owner and he says that since the car has been in the magazine for almost 2weeks he's got a couple of other people interested in it. BUT If I want to come over now and look at it he will sell it to me if I like it since he knows me. Well I get up there and I can hardly contain myself .The car is beautiful.... that’s all I can say simply awesome. At this point I would have given my arm for this little lady. We worked out the price and she comes home this Friday.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. Now I don't know but it seems like this was ment to be. OOOH ALMOST FORGOT this car has got some thing on it that I've never seen before,but has been discussed here ,I don't think anyone has ever done it. Well enough of my rambling  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">I'm just so dam happy. I'll post pics ASAP.||||reg||10
Z||000001||onfire||07-02-2001||02:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by coolcat:<BR><B>OOOH ALMOST FORGOT this car has got some thing on it that I've never seen before,but has been discussed here ,I don't think anyone has ever done it. Well enough of my rambling   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">I'm just so dam happy. I'll post pics ASAP.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>So what is it? Can't wait to see the pics. Glad you got what you want.||||reg||1
